### Root
GET http://localhost:1198/


### Health Check
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/health


### Register Standard User
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ashish Ranjan",
    "email": "ashish@example.com",
    "password": "StrongPassword123"
}


### Login
### Copy accessToken from the response
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "ashish@example.com",
    "password": "StrongPassword123"
}


### Get Authorization Profile
### Replace ACCESS_TOKEN with the token returned by Login
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}


### Authenticated User Resource
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/resources/user
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}


### Moderator Resource
### Standard user should receive 403
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/resources/moderator
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}


### Admin Resource
### Standard user should receive 403
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/resources/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}


### Read Permission Resource
### User needs resource:read permission
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/resources/read
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}


### Manage Resource
### User needs both resource:update and resource:delete
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/resources/manage
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}


### Flexible Resource
### Access requires admin role OR resource:create permission
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/resources/flexible
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}


### API Key Protected Resource
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/api-key/resource
x-api-key: {{API_KEY}}


### API Key Service Info
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/api-key/service-info
x-api-key: {{API_KEY}}


### Invalid API Key
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/api-key/resource
x-api-key: wrong-api-key


### Missing API Key
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/api-key/resource


### Invalid Registration
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "",
    "email": "invalid-email",
    "password": "123"
}


### Duplicate Registration
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ashish Ranjan",
    "email": "ashish@example.com",
    "password": "AnotherPassword123"
}


### Invalid Login
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "ashish@example.com",
    "password": "WrongPassword123"
}


### Missing Bearer Token
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/profile


### Invalid Bearer Token
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token


### ---------------------------------------------------------
### ADMIN TEST FLOW
### ---------------------------------------------------------
### To test admin routes:
### 1. Register another user.
### 2. In MongoDB Compass, change that user's role to "admin".
### 3. Login as that admin user.
### 4. Copy the returned accessToken into ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN.
### 5. Copy the target user's MongoDB _id into USER_ID.


### Register Admin Test Account
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Admin User",
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "password": "AdminPassword123"
}


### Login As Admin
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "password": "AdminPassword123"
}


### Get All Users
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN}}


### Update User Role
PATCH http://localhost:1198/api/v1/admin/users/{{USER_ID}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "role": "moderator"
}


### Update User Permissions
PATCH http://localhost:1198/api/v1/admin/users/{{USER_ID}}/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "permissions": [
        "resource:read",
        "resource:create",
        "resource:update",
        "resource:delete"
    ]
}


### Deactivate User
PATCH http://localhost:1198/api/v1/admin/users/{{USER_ID}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "isActive": false
}


### Activate User
PATCH http://localhost:1198/api/v1/admin/users/{{USER_ID}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "isActive": true
}


### Invalid Role
PATCH http://localhost:1198/api/v1/admin/users/{{USER_ID}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "role": "super-admin"
}


### Invalid Permission
PATCH http://localhost:1198/api/v1/admin/users/{{USER_ID}}/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "permissions": [
        "invalid:permission"
    ]
}


### Non-Admin Access To Admin Route
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}


### Invalid Route
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/not-found